# Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind's "Dragon" is a word of its text (CR 612.2), read as its mana is added. Artificial Evolution
# replaces it with Goblin: the Orb's {R} then gives haste to Mons's Goblin Raiders, a Goblin creature spell it pays for, which
# attacks the turn it was cast (20 to 19); on turn 3 the Orb's mana pays a Firespitter Whelp, a Dragon, which gains no haste.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind
Artificial Evolution
Mons's Goblin Raiders
Firespitter Whelp
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

